<title>USA: L.A. County health dept sees deficit of $188 mln.</title>
<headline>L.A. County health dept sees deficit of $188 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Los Angeles County's health department projected on Wednesday that it could face a $188.1 million deficit in fiscal year 1997/98.</p>
<p>The $188.1 million forecast was down from an earlier estimate by the Department of Health Services. Earlier this month, the department projected a fiscal 1997/98 deficit of $210.3 million.</p>
<p>The department issues regular updates on its financial condition to the Los Angeles County Board of Supervisors. Fiscal year 1997-1998 will begin on July 1.</p>
</text>
